{"question": "Find dy/dx when y = (2x + 1)^5", "groups": [{"id": "line1", "say": "We are given y equals two x plus one, all to the power five."}, {"id": "line2", "say": "A bracket to a power: let u be the inside, so y is u to the five."}, {"id": "line3", "say": "Differentiate each part: dy by du is five u to the four, and du by dx is two."}, {"id": "line4", "say": "Chain rule: multiply them, then put the inside back."}, {"id": "answer", "say": "So dy by dx is ten times two x plus one, to the power four."}, {"id": "annot", "say": "That multiply step is the chain rule."}], "strokes": [{"group": "line1", "d": "M 79.8 113.6 q 3.0 14.0 9.0 26.0 M 99.2 112.5 q -4.0 24.0 -14.0 46.0"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 119.0 123.8 q 11.0 -1.0 22.0 0.0 M 118.5 134.0 q 11.0 1.0 22.0 -1.0"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 169.4 99.9 q -11.0 24.0 0.0 50.0"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 176.0 117.5 q 7.0 -9.0 12.0 -3.0 q 3.0 5.0 -12.0 25.0 q 8.0 -1.0 16.0 0.0"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 198.9 116.4 q 9.0 10.0 18.0 24.0 M 216.5 115.7 q -9.0 12.0 -18.0 24.0"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 248.2 116.5 q -1.0 10.0 0.0 20.0 M 238.1 125.9 q 10.0 -1.0 20.0 0.0"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 279.6 109.5 l 6.0 -5.0 q -1.0 18.0 0.0 35.0"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 293.9 99.7 q 11.0 24.0 0.0 50.0"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 319.5 95.2 q -4.3 -0.6 -8.7 0.0 l -1.2 9.9 q 8.7 -3.7 9.9 5.0 q -1.2 7.4 -11.2 5.0"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 81.8 210.4 q 1.0 20.0 0.0 40.0"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 90.1 238.1 q 8.0 0.0 16.0 0.0 q 0.0 -12.0 -8.0 -12.0 q -9.0 0.0 -8.0 12.0 q 1.0 13.0 16.0 8.0"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 119.2 213.8 q 0.0 17.0 0.0 34.0 q 0.0 4.0 6.0 1.0 M 113.1 225.5 q 7.0 -1.0 14.0 0.0"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 145.5 225.6 q -1.0 22.0 8.0 22.0 q 8.0 0.0 10.0 -22.0 M 164.2 225.9 q -1.0 12.0 0.0 24.0"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 184.8 234.1 q 11.0 -1.0 22.0 0.0 M 184.9 243.8 q 11.0 1.0 22.0 -1.0"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 228.4 228.2 q 7.0 -9.0 12.0 -3.0 q 3.0 5.0 -12.0 25.0 q 8.